WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.968
Ari, today, I Trump's former U.S.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.268
attorney

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.404
general is calling his claims

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.339
of Trump's claims of a witch

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.774
hunt ridiculous.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:08.341
Bill Barr

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.510
says the indictment is very damning

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.411
and described

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.379
the government's case

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:16.149
against Trump as solid

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.351
And this idea of presenting Trump

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.686
as a victim here,

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.655
