00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.924
Yes, he's been a victim in the past.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:25.291
Yes.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.660
His adversaries have obsessively

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.030
