00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.535
when he is a victim.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.669
But this is much different.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.405
He's not a victim here.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.740
He was totally wrong

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.508
that he had the right

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.542
to have those documents.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.443
Those documents are among

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.245
the most sensitive secrets

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:46.780
that the country has.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.380
He

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.048
they have to be

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:50.050
in the custody of the archivist.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.352
He had no right to maintain them

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.953
and retain them.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:57.557
And he kept them in a way at Mar a Lago

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.758
