00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.563
So, Caitlin,

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.098
bring us more about what

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:05.732
Bill Barr,

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.332
the former

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:09.436
attorney general for the former President

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.272
