00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.541
Well, Fred, this has really been

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.975
an extraordinary reaction

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.811
from the former attorney general,

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:19.012
Bill Barr,

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.614
