00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.416
to the level of detail

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.118
that is in this indictment

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.119
of Donald Trump.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:29.923
31 counts of individual documents

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.623
that Donald Trump

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.993
is accused of retaining at Mar a Lago

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.196
where he shouldn't have had them,

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.997
says the Justice Department,

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:39.933
and that there are photos

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.367
