00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:49.709
That is the level of detail

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:50.710
that has caused

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.179
a really, really widespread reaction

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.115
of how serious

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.450
this case is as a national security case

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.251
