00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.130
So they acted in a very patient way.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.599
And where they were met with was,

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.201
according to the government and it

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:51.271
and the indictment, very egregious

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:53.006
obstruction

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.210
Now, Fred, contrast that with Bill Barr.

